WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.940
盐点港的海面之下，潮门背后，藏着一个海中王国。
Beneath Saltpoint Coast, behind the Tidal Gate, lies a kingdom of the sea.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.180
按最古老的律法，王子必须先娶新娘，才能加冕。
By its oldest law, the prince cannot be crowned until he takes a bride.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.960
议会已经替他选好了人。
The council has already chosen one for him.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.460
雷恩王子拒绝了。
Prince Rian has refused her.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.350
而潮门发光时，找到它的人类……会被留下，并忘记一切。
And when the gate glows, any human who finds it is kept... and made to forget.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.800
盐点港海岸 · 清晨 6:12
Saltpoint Coast · 6:12 AM

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.600
Skye，你看！海水在发光！
Skye, look! The water is glowing!

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.450
米拉！
Mila!

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.650
这是……哪里？
Where... am I?

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:52.200
潮门 · 藏在海下的王宫
The Tidal Gate · a palace beneath the sea

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:01.150
我朋友，穿黄外套的。她在哪？
My friend. Yellow jacket. Where is she?

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:07.700
她很安全。访客不得进入这一翼。未登记的访客会被扣留，
She is safe. Visitors cannot enter this wing. Unregistered visitors are held,

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.150
关于这里的记忆，也会被封存。
and their memory of this place is sealed.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:23.600
她跟我一起。
She is with me.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:27.500
我未来的新娘。
My future bride.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:28.650
是真的吗？
Is that true?

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:36.936
她：先配合他，找朋友要紧。
Her: I'll play along. Finding my friend comes first.
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:01:37.036 --> 00:01:39.844
她：……对。是真的。
Yes. It's true.

00:01:40.044 --> 00:01:42.853
答得好。
Good answer.

00:01:43.053 --> 00:01:45.861
先配合到早上。我这就带你去找米拉。
Play along till morning. I'll take you to Mila.

00:01:46.061 --> 00:01:48.870
一个人类新娘。议会会要证据的。
A human bride. The council will want proof.

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:51.878
那他们就会有一场婚礼，夫人。不急。
Then they shall have a wedding, madam. In due time.

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:54.385
三天。之后议会要听结果——立誓，或者否认。
Three days. Then the council hears it—sworn, or denied.

00:01:54.585 --> 00:01:56.892
三天足够了。
Three days is plenty.

00:01:57.092 --> 00:01:59.399
会客厅。她的朋友在那儿等她。很安全。
The guest hall. Her friend is waiting there. Safe.

00:02:02.106 --> 00:02:04.413
跟我来，你们两个。
Come.

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:09.520
她：我搭上他的手，跟维萨去会客厅，立刻见到米拉
Her: I take his hand and follow Vessa to the parlor to see Mila right away.
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:14.434
新娘挽上我的手臂。胆子不小。
So the bride takes my arm. Bold.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:19.448
三天呢。第一小时可别浪费。
Three days. Let's not waste the first hour.

00:02:19.648 --> 00:02:24.462
你先请，我的新娘。
After you, my bride.

00:02:24.662 --> 00:02:27.470
米拉？有人来找你。
Mila? Someone's here for you.

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:30.479
斯凯！你跟着跳下来了？你这个笨蛋！
Skye! You jumped in after me? You idiot!

00:02:30.679 --> 00:02:33.487
你受伤没？看着我——
Are you hurt? Look at me—

00:02:33.687 --> 00:02:36.496
那是——王子？斯凯，他说你是他的——
And that's— the prince? Skye, he said you're his—

00:02:36.696 --> 00:02:39.504
新娘。她答应了嫁条鱼？
Bride. She said yes to a fish?

00:02:39.804 --> 00:02:42.104
她：我拉米拉到沙发上坐下，悄悄告诉她婚约是演的，相机和通行证的事再问王子
Her: I pull Mila onto the sofa and whisper that the engagement is an act; I'll ask the prince about the camera and the passes.
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:02:42.204 --> 00:02:57.046
她：那我要回她的相机。还有我们回家的路。
Then I want her camera back. And our.

00:03:00.254 --> 00:03:01.559
你说什么？！斯凯！
You what?! Skye!

00:03:01.759 --> 00:03:03.063
她在保护你。聪明选择。
She's protecting you. Smart choice.

00:03:03.263 --> 00:03:04.567
所以新娘那套全是演的？
So the whole bride thing is an act?

00:03:04.767 --> 00:03:06.071
被收走了。现在还给你们。
Confiscated. Now returned.

00:03:06.271 --> 00:03:07.575
照片都还在吗？
All the photos are still here?

00:03:07.775 --> 00:03:09.080
两张通行证。是真的。不用结婚。
Two passes. Real. No wedding required.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:10.584
那我们今天就能走，对吧？
Then we can leave today. Right?

00:03:10.784 --> 00:03:12.088
在你决定之前——先问我为什么撒谎。
Before you decide—ask me why I lied.

00:03:12.388 --> 00:03:14.688
她：我拉着米拉起身就走，用通行证今天回盐点港，头也不回
Her: I pull Mila up and we leave, using the passes to get back to Saltpoint today without looking back.
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:03:18.549 --> 00:03:22.109
这就走？行吧。
Going so soon? Fine.

00:03:22.309 --> 00:03:25.870
斯凯，等等——他是认真的？
Skye, wait—is he serious?

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:29.630
潮门现在就开。路我认得。
The tide gate opens now. I know the way.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:32.137
（画外）这边走。
（画外，Rian）This way.

00:03:32.337 --> 00:03:34.644
门认这个。你们会浮到码头边。
The gate reads these. You'll surface by the pier.

00:03:34.844 --> 00:03:37.151
你真的不跟我回去了？
You're really not coming back with me?

00:03:37.351 --> 00:03:39.658
走之前——那个谎。我借你躲了一桩婚事。
Before you go—the lie. I used you to dodge a marriage.

00:03:39.858 --> 00:03:42.165
她叫赛拉。舰队的继承人。我选了省事的谎。
Her name is Sela. The fleet's heir. I chose the easy lie.

00:03:44.972 --> 00:03:47.272
她：你为什么不想和她结婚？
Her: Why don't you want to marry her?
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:03:47.372 --> 00:03:49.693
问得好。
Fair question.

00:03:49.893 --> 00:03:52.214
因为她得到的是一纸条约，不是一个丈夫。
Because she'd get a treaty. Not a husband.

00:03:52.414 --> 00:03:55.222
而我得到一支舰队。我们谁都得不到一个人。
And I'd get a fleet. Neither of us gets a person.

00:03:55.422 --> 00:03:58.231
呃——他的耳朵在发光。
Um—his ears are glowing.

00:03:58.431 --> 00:04:01.239
是洞穴灯光。常有的事。
It's the cave lighting. Happens all the time.

00:04:04.448 --> 00:04:07.256
该你了。通行证就在你手里。你为什么还站在这里？
Your turn. The passes are in your hand. Why are.

00:04:07.556 --> 00:04:09.856
她：我盯着他的耳鳍走近一步，别遮了，接着说，你还藏着什么
Her: I step closer, eyes on his ear fins. Stop hiding it. Go on, what else are you hiding?
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:04:09.956 --> 00:04:14.770
她：别遮了。你还藏着什么？
Don't hide it. What else are you hiding?

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:19.784
好。看吧。不是灯光。
Fine. Look. It's not the lighting.

00:04:19.984 --> 00:04:24.798
还有一件事。说完我就没秘密了。
One more thing. Then I'm out of secrets.

00:04:24.998 --> 00:04:26.947
我早说它们会发光，他非说是灯。
Told you they glow. He said it's the lamps.

00:04:27.147 --> 00:04:29.096
她一走近，灯可不会更亮。
Lamps don't dim when she steps closer.

00:04:29.296 --> 00:04:31.245
我想被你看见的时候，它就会亮。
It happens when I want to be seen.

00:04:31.445 --> 00:04:33.393
那个谎不是撒给议会的。我一个人也能拒绝赛拉。
The lie wasn't for the council. I could refuse Sela alone.

00:04:33.593 --> 00:04:35.542
我只是想要一个留下你的理由。
I wanted a reason to keep you here.

00:04:35.742 --> 00:04:37.691
天哪，你就快点回答他吧。
Oh my god. Just answer him already.

00:04:37.891 --> 00:04:39.840
三晚。真心的。不演戏。留下来。
Three nights. Real ones. No act. Stay.

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:42.440
她：我先把通行证塞给米拉，送她出潮门回岸，再回来赴他的三晚
Her: I press the pass into Mila's hand, see her out the Tide Gate to shore, then come back for his three nights.
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:46.100
她：拿着。回家。
Take these. Go home.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.861
你要留下？跟这条鱼王子？
You're staying? With the fish prince?

00:04:50.061 --> 00:04:53.621
今晚就发照片给你。我说到做到。
Photos tonight. I promise.

00:04:57.582 --> 00:04:59.531
再见，斯凯！
Bye, Skye!

00:04:59.731 --> 00:05:01.680
她走了。想跑，这是最后机会。
She's gone. Last chance to run.

00:05:10.475 --> 00:05:12.424
第一晚，现在开始。
First night starts now.

00:05:12.724 --> 00:05:15.024
她：我跟他下水去礁海，看他的长尾和他的世界
Her: I follow him into the reef sea to see his tail and his world.
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:05:15.124 --> 00:05:17.932
第一晚。那就去我的地盘。
First night. My territory, then.

00:05:21.141 --> 00:05:23.949
先呼吸。它有效——我检查了两遍。
Breathe first. It works—I checked twice.

00:05:24.149 --> 00:05:26.958
她：好。真的有效。
Okay. It works.

00:05:27.158 --> 00:05:29.966
那就抓紧。别松手。
Then hold on. Don't let go.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.487
很好。你很有天分。
Good. You're a natural.

00:05:40.194 --> 00:05:42.501
看。你的世界没那么远。
Look. Your world's not that far.

00:05:42.701 --> 00:05:45.008
跟我比谁先游到光里。赢家可以问一个问题。
Race me to the light. Winner asks one thing.

00:05:45.308 --> 00:05:47.608
她：我在海里和他拥吻，然后看他如何回应我
Her: I kiss him in the sea and see how he answers.
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:05:59.742 --> 00:06:02.550
你知道这算犯规。
That's cheating, you know.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.558
大胆。我喜欢。
Bold move. I like it.

00:06:08.767 --> 00:06:11.575
行，你赢了。犯规的人。
Fine. You win the race. Cheater.

00:06:11.775 --> 00:06:14.584
赢家问一个问题。什么都行。
Winner asks one thing. Anything.

00:06:14.784 --> 00:06:17.592
边游边问。我会说实话。
Ask while we swim. I answer honestly.

00:06:17.892 --> 00:06:20.192
她：我先问我的问题，这三晚结束之后，你会怎样
Her: My question first: when the three nights are over, what happens to you?
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:06:20.292 --> 00:06:23.852
她：三晚之后——你会怎样？
After three nights—what happens to you?

00:06:24.052 --> 00:06:27.613
一上来就问最难的。行。
Straight to the hard one. Of course.

00:06:27.813 --> 00:06:31.373
诚实的答案需要空气。上来。
Honest answer needs air. Come up.

00:06:38.342 --> 00:06:41.151
谎话了结。你回家，自由。
The lie dies. You go home, free.

00:06:41.351 --> 00:06:44.159
而我呢？我去面对议会。还有赛拉。
And me? I face the council. And Sela.

00:06:44.359 --> 00:06:47.168
我从来没在夜里上过岸。一次都没有。
Never been ashore at night. Not once.

00:06:47.368 --> 00:06:50.176
你赢了，该你带路。今晚你说了算。
Your win, your turn. Lead tonight.

00:06:50.476 --> 00:06:52.776
她：我先不答应，逼他回答，议会逼你娶赛拉时你打算怎么办
Her: I don't agree yet. I make him answer: when the council forces you to marry Sera, what will you do?
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:06:52.876 --> 00:06:55.684
她：你先回答我。赛拉。议会。
Answer me first. Sela. The council.

00:06:55.884 --> 00:06:58.693
不开玩笑。明白。
No jokes. Understood.

00:06:58.893 --> 00:07:01.701
我会拒绝她。王冠要不要都行。
I refuse her. Crown or no crown.

00:07:01.901 --> 00:07:04.710
一纸条约绑不住我。舰队也不行。
A treaty won't hold me. Not even a fleet.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:07.718
该我了。
My turn now.

00:07:07.918 --> 00:07:10.726
三晚结束的时候——你会在哪里？
When the three nights end—where will you be?

00:07:13.935 --> 00:07:16.743
不敢回答？也正常。
Scared to answer? That's fair.

00:07:16.943 --> 00:07:19.752
你不用给我一句话。只要一个方向。
You don't owe me words. Just a direction.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:25.360
她：我拉起他的手朝岸上灯火游，今晚带他逛盐点港夜市，教他排队买烤鱼
Her: I take his hand and swim toward the shore lights, taking him to the Saltpoint night market to teach him to queue for grilled fish.
（实时生成 · 15+15 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:29.020
她：不说话，只管游。
No words. Just swim.

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:32.781
这就算你的回答？够大胆。
That's my answer? Bold.

00:07:32.981 --> 00:07:36.541
你世界的夜晚。你带路。
Your world at night. Lead the way.

00:07:36.741 --> 00:07:40.302
第一晚上岸。别让我给你丢脸。
First night ashore. Don't let me embarrass you.

00:07:43.009 --> 00:07:45.316
原来人类要排队。买鱼也要。
So humans line up. For fish.

00:07:48.023 --> 00:07:50.330
你们用纸付钱？不用珍珠？
You pay with paper? Not pearls?

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.837
行，这队排得值。
Okay. The line was worth it.

